---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
import { GOVERN_PARTNER_URL } from "../../data/docs";
---

<DocsLayout title="Echophi — REST + Webhooks">
  <h1>REST + Webhooks</h1>
  <p>
    Use REST for request/response operations (trigger calls, read contacts, manage campaigns). Use webhooks for
    asynchronous outcomes so you do not poll every conversation.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="/playground">Playground</a> — execute REST only
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href={GOVERN_PARTNER_URL} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        Govern → Partner API
      </a>{" "}
      — register endpoints and inspect Recent Deliveries
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>Inbound events always POST to your HTTPS URL, never to the Playground.</p>
</DocsLayout>
